<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>루피안 커뮤니티</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Pretendard", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }
    header {
      background: #020617;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
    }
    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    nav a {
      margin-left: 16px;
      color: #cbd5f5;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #2563eb);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .hero h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    .hero p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .boards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .board {
      background: #020617;
      border: 1px solid #1e293b;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px;
      transition: transform 0.2s, border 0.2s;
    }
    .board:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .board h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .board p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 48px;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
      border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>루피안</h1>
  <nav>
    <a href="#">홈</a>
    <a href="#">자유게시판</a>
    <a href="#">콘텐츠</a>
    <a href="#">아이디어</a>
    <a href="#">공지</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <section class="hero">
    <h2>상상력 있는 사람들이 모이는 곳</h2>
    <p>루피안은 게임, 창작, 아이디어를 자유롭게 나누는 커뮤니티입니다.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="boards">
    <div class="board">
      <h3>💬 자유게시판</h3>
      <p>잡담, 질문, 일상 이야기</p>
    </div>
    <div class="board">
      <h3>🎮 콘텐츠</h3>
      <p>마인크래프트, 영상, 음악</p>
    </div>
    <div class="board">
      <h3>🧠 아이디어</h3>
      <p>기획, 세계관, 프로젝트 모집</p>
    </div>
    <div class="board">
      <h3>📢 공지사항</h3>
      <p>운영 소식과 이벤트</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<footer>
  © 2026 Lupian Community. All rights reserved.
</footer>

  <script>
    const boards = document.querySelectorAll('.board');
    boards.forEach(board => {
      board.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const title = board.querySelector('h3').innerText;
        localStorage.setItem('currentBoard', title);
        window.location.href = 'board.html';
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
